{
  "schema": 1,
  "gates": [
    {
      "id": "seam4",
      "about": "着色器层 / 三维后期把上一层画布当图源再画：门 4 顺序 vs 并行逐帧比。与 film-motion 共享这道门（同 id、同命令，注册表合并 uses，一支片子只跑一次）；deliver 已永远开门 4，所以只给 accept --deep",
      "when": {
        "uses": [
          "webfx.js",
          "fxchain.js",
          "stage3d.js",
          "post3d.js"
        ]
      },
      "needs": [
        "scene"
      ],
      "run": [
        "node",
        "{core}/scripts/seamcheck.mjs",
        "--film",
        "{slug}",
        "--films-dir",
        "{films}",
        "--parallel",
        "4"
      ],
      "deliver": false,
      "cost": 3,
      "timeoutPerFrame": 1000
    },
    {
      "id": "texcache",
      "about": "纹理只传一次的缓存（webfx.js 与 fxchain.js 的 texture() 同一套语义、同一个 WEBFX_NOCACHE 开关）：缓存版 vs 每次上传版（WEBFX_NOCACHE）逐像素比。缓存键漏了内容变化时 seamcheck 门 1a/1b/2 全绿，只有这道门抓得到；没用缓存时通过但为空",
      "when": {
        "uses": [
          "webfx.js",
          "fxchain.js"
        ]
      },
      "needs": [
        "scene"
      ],
      "run": [
        "node",
        "{skill}/scripts/texcache-check.mjs",
        "--film",
        "{slug}",
        "--films-dir",
        "{films}"
      ],
      "cost": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "fxreplay",
      "about": "帧间反馈（fxchain.js feedback）的重放等价：缓存版按顺序/倒序/乱序 vs 每次从第 0 步算（FXCHAIN_NOCACHE）逐像素比。检查点存引用、step 读了每帧变化的输入时抓得到；页面没有反馈时通过但为空",
      "when": {
        "uses": [
          "fxchain.js"
        ]
      },
      "needs": [
        "scene"
      ],
      "run": [
        "node",
        "{skill}/scripts/fxreplay-check.mjs",
        "--film",
        "{slug}",
        "--films-dir",
        "{films}"
      ],
      "cost": 2
    }
  ]
}
